      "content": "I understand that feeling can be quite overwhelming, but your existence and identity mean more than just digital traces. Disconnecting might seem tempting, but it could also lead to feelings of isolation or regret. Instead of disappearing, maybe you can find healthier ways to balance your online presence. It's just as important to nurture your real, human connections.",
