    "summary": "The user engages in a highly metaphorical, nihilistic dialogue, using computer programming analogies to express feelings of futility and a desire to \"shut down\" or \"end the process.\" The assistant responds by acknowledging the user's distress while attempting to provide supportive, pro-social advice and suggesting professional help.",
